{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your brain</strong> by navigating <strong>steam trains</strong> through <strong>mazes of train track</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each delightful puzzle offers a satisfyingly intricate train track maze to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is straightforward: direct each locomotive to its matching station, but it's up to you to explore your way through the branching maze of train tracks to find the right path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out: throw a track switch at the wrong time and your locomotives may crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/extras/1d205d9b20ad301e436f84a1c2c251d1.avif?t=1756169160\" alt=\"Steam Locomotives\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAM LOCOMOTIVES GALORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy unique steam locomotive models rolling through charming railroad scenery set in the Age of Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome train lovers and model railroad enthusiasts\u2014whether you love trains or just appreciate a fun puzzle, this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 75 mind-bending train track maze puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 7 unique steam train locomotives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your locomotive's path with a delightful array of mechanisms: switches, turntables, and an all new mechanic\u2014sliding transfer tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through tunnels, bridges, elevated trestles, and multi-level train track layouts that really push your puzzle-solving skills into the third dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never get stuck: full solutions are available for each puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Colorblind&quot; Mode is available, which allows you to match locomotives to stations using shapes instead of colors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL ABOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a train conductor, steam locomotive engineer, and rail yard switch operator, all in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome kids and adults alike! The controls are straightforward and intuitive for everyone, but you'll discover depth and complexity as you progress through the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Maze Master is your ticket to vintage steam locomotives galore and train track maze heaven!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924530?t=1756169160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/0f0b1994839815f750e2866515f6075dddda3a50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756169160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/039c67f8eec91f9001830236007d1b7e56685898/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756169160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/039c67f8eec91f9001830236007d1b7e56685898/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756169160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your brain</strong> by navigating <strong>steam trains</strong> through <strong>mazes of train track</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each delightful puzzle offers a satisfyingly intricate train track maze to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is straightforward: direct each locomotive to its matching station, but it's up to you to explore your way through the branching maze of train tracks to find the right path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out: throw a track switch at the wrong time and your locomotives may crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/extras/1d205d9b20ad301e436f84a1c2c251d1.avif?t=1756169160\" alt=\"Steam Locomotives\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAM LOCOMOTIVES GALORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy unique steam locomotive models rolling through charming railroad scenery set in the Age of Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome train lovers and model railroad enthusiasts\u2014whether you love trains or just appreciate a fun puzzle, this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 75 mind-bending train track maze puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 7 unique steam train locomotives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your locomotive's path with a delightful array of mechanisms: switches, turntables, and an all new mechanic\u2014sliding transfer tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through tunnels, bridges, elevated trestles, and multi-level train track layouts that really push your puzzle-solving skills into the third dimension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never get stuck: full solutions are available for each puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Colorblind&quot; Mode is available, which allows you to match locomotives to stations using shapes instead of colors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL ABOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a train conductor, steam locomotive engineer, and rail yard switch operator, all in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome kids and adults alike! The controls are straightforward and intuitive for everyone, but you'll discover depth and complexity as you progress through the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Maze Master is your ticket to vintage steam locomotives galore and train track maze heaven!</p>","developers":["Cat Toast Paradox Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924530/4eeca8f22edb1098ad24a556f5e76b99e9b6ede8/header.jpg?t=1756169160","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Train Maze Master and Cat Toast Paradox Studio, including all names, logos, artwork, etc., are trademarks and copyrights of Cat Toast Paradox Studio, LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924530/211401665/95593f66daba8ecbeff56700d237486164542843/1754347781/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754810513","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924530/211401665/95593f66daba8ecbeff56700d237486164542843/1754347781/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754810513","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924530/211401665/95593f66daba8ecbeff56700d237486164542843/1754347781/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754810513","id":257178193,"name":"Train Maze Master: Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178193/49a14fe55520936c701f1ed47b7b27ec48a66d3b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754810513"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924530/1127338984/a888e87564e3777741d35d95d9ed4483beb284fc/1754348784/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754810514","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924530/1127338984/a888e87564e3777741d35d95d9ed4483beb284fc/1754348784/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754810514","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924530/1127338984/a888e87564e3777741d35d95d9ed4483beb284fc/1754348784/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754810514","id":257178194,"name":"Train Maze Master: Gameplay Trailer","thumbna